 "name_en": "Complementary Invoice – Pricing (2UT)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Complementary Invoice – Pricing (2UT)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio84db85f377754fabb148cb88f8a95087\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio84db85f377754fabb148cb88f8a95087__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">If there is a price difference in the Nota Fiscal, a price complement is required. This takes the form of a debit to the vendor (such as an adjustment to the process), and is like a second invoice based on the same goods receipt from the original invoice.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">We recommend that you change the purchase order value so that the system does not block MIRO postings based on tolerance limits.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio84db85f377754fabb148cb88f8a95087__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Provide complementary invoices</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Approve purchase orders and supplier invoices</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio84db85f377754fabb148cb88f8a95087__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Provide complementary invoicing to cover Brazilian localization requirements</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>补充发票 – 定价 (2UT)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio84db85f377754fabb148cb88f8a95087\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio84db85f377754fabb148cb88f8a95087__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">如果发票中存在价格差异，则需要价格补充。这采用供应商的借项形式（例如调整流程），类似于基于原始发票中相同收货的第二张发票。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">我们建议您更改采购订单值，以便系统不会根据容差限制冻结 MIRO 过账。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio84db85f377754fabb148cb88f8a95087__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">提供补充发票</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审批采购订单和供应商发票</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio84db85f377754fabb148cb88f8a95087__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">提供补充发票，满足巴西本地化要求</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
